(1193,2503,'Any of various strains of papovavirus that cause warts, especially of the hands, feet, and genitals, with some strains believed to be a causative factor in cancer of the cervix, vagina, and vulva.','en',2,'2026-06-30 10:39:53',NULL,NULL,'1215FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF'),
